== Walkthrough ==

''[[a drunkard]] can be found wandering between three [[Greater Faydark|Kelethin]] platforms, starting at location 577, 388, 161, with a brief pause at location 429, 392, 161.''

: a drunkard says, 'Please... Can anyone spare some coppers? <Hic>... Anyone?'

You say, 'Hail, a drunkard'

: a drunkard says 'Can you spare some copper or silver? I just.. <Hic>.. need some change to buy something to drin.. er.. eat. <Hic>..'

'''Hand [[a drunkard]] an [[Elven Wine]], purchased from most any barkeep in [[Greater Faydark|Kelethin]].'''

: a drunkard says, 'Oh.. .. Thank you!! Oh, what has become of me?! Look at me!! I was great once. I wish I never had that shocking experience.'

You say, 'What shocking experience?'

''The quest then progresses from this same point in [[Bandit Sisters]].''

